sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Demo user
    participant Form as CheckIn form
    participant App as React App state
    participant Rules as Demonstration rules
    participant Views as Dashboard and trends
    Note over User,Views: SI-assisted diagram | Synthetic demo data only
    User->>Form: Select crew and enter check-in values
    Form->>Form: Apply browser input constraints
    User->>Form: Review check-in
    Form-->>User: Show crew, values, units and notes
    User->>Form: Confirm review and record
    Form->>App: onSave draft
    App->>App: Replace selected crew latest reading
    App->>App: Set session check-in flag
    App->>Rules: Recompute derived comparisons
    Rules-->>Views: Updated values, labels and observations
    App-->>Form: Show check-in success
    User->>Views: Open dashboard or change trend controls
    Views->>Views: Render synthetic history and latest value
    Note over App,Views: Baselines use prior synthetic JSON days and fixture files remain unchanged
    User->>App: Refresh page
    App->>App: Reset to initial fictional demo state
